         "alt": "Two department-store storefronts share a single encoded tag SKU: the Macy's side also covers Bloomingdale's, the Nordstrom side covers Nordstrom Rack, Nordstrom CA and Rack CA — one tag, at least two scorecards, with tag origin, converter lists and per-banner placement as the three differences that quibble."
